{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":false,"translated":true},"context":"nine-mens-morris UI copy.details","detected_language":"zh","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"nine-mens-morris.copy.details","keys":["nine-mens-morris.copy.details"],"locale":"zh-CN","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"每位玩家轮流放置九枚棋子。 放置完棋子后,沿着标记线移动一枚棋子到相邻的空点。 若果您正好有三枚棋子,您就可以飞到任意空点。 形成磨坊会移除对手的一枚棋子。 若果您将对手减少为两枚棋子或是让对手无法移动,您就会获胜。","record_id":"df9794b9672bbf6bd7017e23bd8a015d42877806a0cf76a7860531700fbb2a30","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.2195258132500157,"source":"Each player places nine pieces in turn. After placement, move one piece along a marked line to a neighboring empty point. If you have exactly three pieces, this version lets you fly to any empty point. Forming a mill removes one opponent piece. You win by reducing the opponent to two pieces or leaving them with no legal move. A repeated position or 200-turn limit is a draw.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"94bcf79f949c5c356bee432117345f05fed6ef0d578c713237ea702c39b10360","status":"needs-review","translation":"每位玩家轮流放置九枚棋子。 放置完棋子后,沿着标记线移动一枚棋子到相邻的空点。 若果您正好有三枚棋子,您就可以飞到任意空点。 形成磨坊会移除对手的一枚棋子。 若果您将对手减少为两枚棋子或是让对手无法移动,您就会获胜。","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
